    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on darwin1859-ch12-11: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.82";
    dc:description "The variables have direct modern measures and suitable global databases. Historical connectivity and correlated geography limit causal discrimination, but stratified sensitivity analyses are feasible.";
