    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For continental islands, model mammal taxonomic or phylogenetic similarity to the nearest mainland against channel depth while controlling for distance, island area and climate. A persistent negative depth effect confirms the claim; no effect or the opposite refutes it.";
